        "raw_text": "18\nSix THEO courses with at least one course at 2000 or above level and another two courses at 3000 or above level.\nTotal:\n18\nCourse List\nCourse Code\nCourse Title\nUnit(s)\nFaculty Package Course\nTHEO1000\nApproaches to Christian Studies\n3\nArea 1: Biblical Studies\nTHEO1211\nIntroduction to the Hebrew Bible\n3\nTHEO1212\nIntroduction to the New Testament\n3\nTHEO2211\nPentateuchal Studies\n3\nTHEO2212\nProphetic Literature\n3\nTHEO2213\nWisdom and the Psalms\n3\nTHEO2214\nSynoptic Gospels\n3\nTHEO2215\nJohannine Literature\n3\nTHEO2216\nPauline Letters\n3\nTHEO3213\nBiblical Studies: Special Topics I\n3\nTHEO3214\nBiblical Studies: Special Topics II\n3\nTHEO3215\nNew Testament Greek I\n3\nTHEO3216\nNew Testament Greek II\n3\nTHEO3217\nBiblical Hebrew I\n3\nTHEO3218\nBiblical Hebrew II\n3\nArea 2: History of Christianity\nTHEO2221\nEarly and Medieval Church\n3\nTHEO3220\nHistory of Christianity: Special Topics I\n3\nTHEO3221\nHistory of Christianity in China\n3\nTHEO3222\nHistory of Christianity in Hong Kong\n3\nTHEO3229\nHistory of Christianity: Special Topics II\n3\nArea 3: Theology\nTHEO2231\nHumanity and Salvation\n3\nTHEO2234\nCatholic Dogmatic\n3\nTHEO2235\nSystematic Theology I\n3\nTHEO2236\nSystematic Theology II\n3\nTHEO3235\nTheological Studies: Special Topics I\n3\nTHEO3236\nTheological Studies: Special Topics II\n3\nArea 4: Pastoral Studies\nTHEO2241\nPastoral Theology\n3\nTHEO3240\nLocal Church Study\n3\nTHEO3241\nHomiletics\n3\nTHEO3242\nDenominational Tradition and Polity\n3\nTHEO3244\nLiturgics\n3\nTHEO3245\nPreaching\n2\nTHEO3246\nDeath and Dying\n3\nTHEO3247\nPastoral Studies: Special Topics I\n3\nTHEO3248\nPastoral Studies: Special Topics II\n3\nTHEO4241\nField Education I\n2\nTHEO4242\nField Education II\n2\nArea 5: Christianity and Society\nTHEO2251\nFoundation of Religious Education\n3\nTHEO3252\nApproaches to Mission Studies\n3\nTHEO3254\nChristian Ethics\n3\nTHEO3255\nChristianity and Society: Special Topics I\n3\